    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dash, Bash and crash into your friends!</strong><br><br><strong>Skullbangers</strong> is a lightning-paced party game where reaction speed and wit will win the day!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>* <strong> Pick-up-and-play extravaganza:</strong> The minimalist ruleset means that anyone can jump in and compete in an instant!<br>* <strong> Fully customizable game parameters:</strong> Tweak every game parameter to craft your perfect ruleset<br>* <strong>Game modes and mutators:</strong> Change between Deathmatch and the Hot Potato mode and if you're looking for a twist, enable the vast array of mutators!<br>* <strong>Fully voice acted cast:</strong> Get to know the full Skullbangers cast and their relationships<br>* <strong>Online Multiplayer Support:</strong> Play together with friends using the integrated Steam Remote Play Together with full controller support<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Best enjoyed with controllers</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/bac7106eecab1a34869ec8186e817df6.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dash, Bash and crash into your friends!</strong><br><br><strong>Skullbangers</strong> is a lightning-paced party game where reaction speed and wit will win the day!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/afa925c3f19478cf18d60feee6bde584.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>* <strong> Pick-up-and-play extravaganza:</strong> The minimalist ruleset means that anyone can jump in and compete in an instant!<br>* <strong> Fully customizable game parameters:</strong> Tweak every game parameter to craft your perfect ruleset<br>* <strong>Game modes and mutators:</strong> Change between Deathmatch and the Hot Potato mode and if you're looking for a twist, enable the vast array of mutators!<br>* <strong>Fully voice acted cast:</strong> Get to know the full Skullbangers cast and their relationships<br>* <strong>Online Multiplayer Support:</strong> Play together with friends using the integrated Steam Remote Play Together with full controller support<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.poster.avif?t=1621091747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.webm?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1519880/extras/45d08f9ebdfa220202c4fef813dd332e.mp4?t=1621091747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Best enjoyed with controllers</strong>",
